<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 237-1 AT TEA V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 237-1 AT TEA V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were 237 for one at tea on the third day of the first test match against India on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 1st innings 237-1 (S.Jayasuriya 130 not out, R.Mahanama 76 not out); India 1st innings 537 for 8 declared.</p>
